# JESD204 link bring-up framework
#
# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

config JESD204
	bool "JESD204 link bring-up state machine"
	help
	  Phase-ordered bring-up for JESD204 links, as in the Linux and
	  ADI no-OS jesd204 frameworks. A JESD204 link only comes up when
	  every participating device -- clock generator, converter, FPGA
	  transceiver and FPGA link cores -- passes through the same phases
	  together. Each device registers a table of callbacks indexed by
	  phase, and the framework walks the phases in order rather than the
	  ordering being hand-written per board.

	  Enable this if a board brings up a JESD204 link. Say n if the
	  converters in use stream over something else.
